    "text": "Compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> used as a strong oxidizing agent is amphoteric in nature. It is the part of lead storage batteries. Compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;is:"
